'''Red Card''' (Japanese: '''レッドカード''' ''Red Card'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Your opponent shuffles their hand into their deck and draws 3 cards.
}}

==Release information==
Red Card cards were first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each. One copy of Red Card is also awarded to players who complete the {{TCGP|mission}} "09: Play a Supporter card!" in the {{DL|Mission (TCG Pocket)|Battle Guide}}.

==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Mars}} has a more potent version of this card's effect, but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an Item card.
* This card's effect closely resembles the {{TCG|Red Card}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but the opponent draws 3 cards instead of 4.

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Red Card|124}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
* The [[Red Card]] is a [[held item]] introduced in the [[Generation V]] [[Pokémon games]]. This card depicts a Red Card as it appears in the [[core series]] games.

